{"id": "unknown-2026-05-14-002", "date": "2026-05-14", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 20, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": -0.17, "keywords": ["improve", "weak", "pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India’s textile reset is here. The winners will be built, not picked.", "content": "India’s textile sector is entering an execution-led phase, with Warangal PM MITRA Park, UKITMC and CETA aligning capacity, technology and market access. \nDuty-free UK access can improve competitiveness, but only if factories deliver scale, compliance, traceability and faster turnaround. \nWeak apparel output, cotton cost risks and import-duty pressure remain key constraints.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-s-textile-reset-is-here-the-winners-will-be-built-not-picked--310302-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-14-003", "date": "2026-05-14", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 20, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cotton_price"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": ["improve", "concerns"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "ICE cotton futures close higher on dry weather concerns in US", "content": "ICE cotton futures closed higher on persistent dry weather concerns in key US growing regions, especially Texas, which supported speculative buying.\nStrong crude oil prices and expectations of improved Chinese demand also boosted sentiment.\nJuly 2026 cotton settled at 86.81 cents per pound, the strongest close since April 2024, while traders maintained cautious bullish positions.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/ice-cotton-futures-close-higher-on-dry-weather-concerns-in-us-310304-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
